    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 3a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">gebuge georne into mynstre mid eallum eaðmettum ⁊ misdæda geswice ⁊ bete swyþe georne þæt he abrocen hæbbe; geþence word ⁊ wedd þe he Gode betæhte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">he shall readily return into the monastery with all humility, and desist from his evil ways, and zealously make amends for the transgressions he has committed. Let him remember the vows which he rendered to God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
